# Game assets (copyrighted EA / RA2 original assets) — excluded on purpose
*.mix
*.gbf
*.bin
*.yrm
*.dmp
*.pack
*.exe
*.rgout
*.sav
*.mmx
*.pkl
*.log
*.jsonl

# Full RA2 / Yuri's Revenge installs used as test benches — copyrighted EA
# assets plus gamemd.exe. Never redistributed (same rule as the extensions above).
ra2bench/
ra2youli/

# Local state / caches
.mimosa/
.zcode/
# browser-CDP scratch + live auth QR + session state
.zcode-watch/
.workbuddy/
.pi/
.dsh-probe/
.commandcode/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/
out/
scratch/

# Third-party RA2 reverse-engineering lib (Ares-Developers/YRpp), not redistributed
YRpp/
*_controls.stdout.log
*_controls.stderr.log
examples/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 铁律 2：cpp/h 不上公开仓（含"备份"目录里的源码副本）
#   D-01 方案 A（2026-10-23）已把最后 10 个逆向件移出索引，
#   全仓**零**已跟踪 .cpp/.h ⇒ 原先「不全量忽略，因为另有刻意公开的头文件」
#   的前提消失，改回全量忽略。将来确有需公开的头文件时用 `git add -f` 显式放行。
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.cpp
*.h
*.hpp
*.cc
*.cxx

# 编译中间产物
*.obj
*.o
*.dll
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.lib

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 铁律 10：崩溃转储与 except.txt 副本不上公开仓
#   （`ra2youli/` 已整体忽略；这里堵的是被搬到 lead/ 下的证据副本）
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/except_after*.txt
**/except_pre*.txt
**/except_post*.txt
**/probe_*/except*.txt

# 扫描器空输出残留
*.err

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 铁律 2 续：本轮新增的 RC-4 守卫副本件
#   `rc4_guard.cpp` / `rc4_loader.cpp` 是补丁副本源码（含 cave 机器码），
#   `ra2rc4guard.dll` 是编译产物 ⇒ 一律不上公开仓。
#   ★ 2026-10-23 D-01 方案 A 执行后，`ra2render/*.cpp|*.h|*.obj|*.dll` 已移出索引，
#     全仓不再有已跟踪的 cpp/h/obj/dll；上面 `*.cpp`/`*.h`/`*.dll` 全量规则已兜住。
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/rc4_guard*.cpp
**/rc4_loader*.cpp
**/ra2rc4guard*.dll

